&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Sony Interactive Entertainment?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment isn’t just the Best Place to Play — it’s also the Best Place to Work. Sony Interactive Entertainment (SIE) is the company behind the PlayStation brand. As a subsidiary of Sony Group Corporation, we’re part of a proud legacy of innovation and excellence. SIE is a dynamic technology company, delivering cutting-edge hardware and network services to more than 100 million people and an entertainment leader, home to some of the most beloved and recognizable intellectual properties (IP) in the world. Our role at SIE is to create and nurture the experiences under the PlayStation brand, a name synonymous with entertainment excellence and creativity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This position is for temporary engagement through our staffing partner, Yoh Enterprise Solutions. Candidates must be authorized to work in the United States for this position.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Bend Studio, creator of&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Days Gone&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Uncharted: Golden Abyss&lt;/em&gt;, and &lt;em&gt;Syphon Filter&lt;/em&gt;, is seeking outstanding talent to join our passionate and creative team in crafting our next high-profile console title.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re seeking an experienced Producer who will be relied upon to collaborate with creative leads and studio directors to develop, maintain, and execute project planning for your teams. You are the strategic thinker for your teams - get out front and lead. The ideal candidate will possess a combination of strong project management and communication skills, and a passion for making great games. Help us create and launch our next title!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate the development of game features and content across several cross-discipline and/or support teams (such as audio, UI, and core tech) through established phases of development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the overall development roadmap and backlogs for your features/teams, taking responsibility for their day-to-day operations, utilizing project management tools (such as Jira) to ensure deliverables are on time and meet the expected requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be responsible for the scope and capacity of your teams and identify outsourcing opportunities in collaboration with the feature leads, discipline leads and Lead Producer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the discussion on breaking down sprint goals for your teams. Operate as their Sprint Planning Facilitator and check-in/follow-up to ensure all tasks are entered, properly estimated and tracked/updated.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use project management tools to develop roadmaps, collect data, and identify when individuals are over capacity for the sprint.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure sprint deliverables stay on track.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Protect the team during the sprint - facilitate discussions regarding scope creep and prioritizing task trade-offs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Surface discipline-specific support needs (design, art, engineering, QA) for feature teams, and align with Lead Producer on staffing, co-dev, and priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run standups, sprint planning, retrospectives, and communication between teams and leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate and/or participate in bug triage for your teams, in collaboration with engineering and QA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify impediments, risks and blockers early, create mitigation plans, and communicate them to stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure your features and content are reviewed and delivered on time and ensure all requirements are met.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills and the ability to communicate across disciplines and with stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Jira, workflows, backlog management, and reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Microsoft Office (Word, Excel, Outlook, PowerPoint), Confluence (Wiki) and other project tracking and bug database software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient with the use of agile and traditional waterfall production management techniques, and an understanding of when to use different approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively seek improvements, whether through process refinement, risk management, or personal growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant industry experience with a proven track record of shipping titles in a production role for a large team of cross-discipline developers&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At SIE, working with our partners, we consider several factors when setting each role’s base pay range, including the competitive benchmarking data for the market and geographic location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Please note that the individual base pay range may vary based on job-related factors which may include knowledge, skills, experience, and location.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In addition, this role is eligible for benefit offerings that include medical, dental, and vision. Click &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dzconnex.com/summary-of-benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to learn more.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The estimated base pay range for this role is listed below, this is an hourly rate.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$60&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$60 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please note, Sony Interactive Entertainment conducts background checks at the offer stage for all new employees (which may include criminal background checks for some roles) and will need to process personal information to support these checks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please refer to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.playstation.com/legal/careers-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for more information about what personal information we collect, how we use it, who we share it with, and your data protection rights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All persons will receive consideration for employment without regard to gender (including gender identity, gender expression and gender reassignment), race (including colour, nationality, ethnic or national origin), religion or belief, marital or civil partnership status, disability, age, sexual orientation, pregnancy, maternity or parental status, trade union membership or membership in any other legally protected category.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We strive to create an inclusive environment, empower employees and embrace diversity. We encourage everyone to respond.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment is a Fair Chance employer and qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records will be considered for employment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
